    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25539" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπιστεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>entrust to</i> one <i>in confidence,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ τὴν πόλιν, τὴν δυναστείαν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.40.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ θεῷ τὰν ὠνάν</span>
			Rüsch <i>Grammatik der delph.Inschr.</i><i><span class="en">
				p.326
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινὶ περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.188
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>believe thoroughly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				673a17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				10.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dat.,
				<i>have confidence in, believe,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PHib.
				1.147
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be trusted</i> or <i>believed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				10.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Gaz.
				<u>Thphr.</u>
				p.18B.
			</span></i></div>
